  "talents_description": {
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_1_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>You cannot attack.</font></b> \n\n Total Damage Taken Reduction: 10%",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_1_1": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>You cannot attack.</font></b> \n\n Total Damage Taken Reduction: <b><font color='#eabe10'>10%</font></b>",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_2_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Requiem of Souls.</font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: Righteous Lord \n\n Every second, the hero takes massive magic damage from maximum health. Nearby enemies take magic damage based on your maximum health. Works while you have Health. When the ability is activated, it increases spell damage. \n\n Self Damage: 60 + 3% of Maximum Health\nEnemy Damage: 30 + 3% of Maximum Health\nSpell Damage: 20% \nRange: 300",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_2_1": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Requiem of Souls.</font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Righteous Lord</font></b> \n\n Every second, the hero takes massive magic damage from maximum health. Nearby enemies take magic damage based on your maximum health. Works while you have Health. When the ability is activated, it increases spell damage. \n\n Self Damage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>60</font></b> + <b><font color='#eabe10'>3%</font></b> of Maximum Health\nEnemy Damage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>30</font></b> \nEnemy Damage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>3%</font></b> + <b><font color='#eabe10'>20%</font></b> of Maximum Health\nRange: 300",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_3_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Feast of Souls.</font></b> \n\n Health Regeneration: 0.3%/0.6%/0.9%",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_3_1": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Feast of Souls.</font></b> \n\n Health Regeneration: <b><font color='#eabe10'>0.3%</font></b>/0.6%/0.9%",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_3_2": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Feast of Souls.</font></b> \n\n Health Regeneration: 0.3%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>0.6%</font></b>/0.9%",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_3_3": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Feast of Souls.</font></b> \n\n Health Regeneration: 0.3%/0.6%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>0.9%</font></b>",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_4_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Necromastery.</font></b> \n\n Righteous Lord Radius Increase: 150/300",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_4_1": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Necromastery.</font></b> \n\n Righteous Lord Radius Increase: <b><font color='#eabe10'>150</font></b>/300",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_4_2": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Necromastery.</font></b> \n\n Righteous Lord Radius Increase: 150/<b><font color='#eabe10'>300</font></b>",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_5_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Presence Of The Dark Lord.</font></b> \n\n <b><font color='#ff0000'>Spell Damage: -40%/-35%/-30%</font></b> \n\n Righteous Lord deals Pure Damage to enemies.",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_5_1": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Presence Of The Dark Lord.</font></b> \n\n <b><font color='#ff0000'>Spell Damage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>-40%</font></b>/-35%/-30%</font></b> \n\n Righteous Lord deals <b><font color='#eabe10'>Pure Damage</font></b> to enemies.",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_5_2": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Presence Of The Dark Lord.</font></b> \n\n <b><font color='#ff0000'>Spell Damage: -40%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>-35%</font></b>/-30%</font></b> \n\n Righteous Lord deals <b><font color='#eabe10'>Pure Damage</font></b> to enemies.",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_5_3": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Presence Of The Dark Lord.</font></b> \n\n <b><font color='#ff0000'>Spell Damage: -40%/-35%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>-30%</font></b></font></b> \n\n Righteous Lord deals <b><font color='#eabe10'>Pure Damage</font></b> to enemies.",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_6_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Shadowraze.</font></b> \n\n Increases Spell Damage by 1% for every 400/300/200 Maximum Health.",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_6_1": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Shadowraze.</font></b> \n\n Increases Spell Damage by <b><font color='#eabe10'>1%</font></b> for every <b><font color='#eabe10'>400</font></b>/300/200 Maximum Health.",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_6_2": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Shadowraze.</font></b> \n\n Increases Spell Damage by <b><font color='#eabe10'>1%</font></b> for every 400/<b><font color='#eabe10'>300</font></b>/200 Maximum Health.",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_6_3": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Shadowraze.</font></b> \n\n Increases Spell Damage by <b><font color='#eabe10'>1%</font></b> for every 400/300/<b><font color='#eabe10'>200</font></b> Maximum Health.",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_7_0": "New Passive Ability: Eye of Fiend \n\n Reduces enemy Health Restoration by 1% for every 3% of the hero's Missing Health. \n\n Radius: 700",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_7_1": "New Passive Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Eye of Fiend</font></b> \n\n Reduces enemy Health Restoration by <b><font color='#eabe10'>1%</font></b> for every <b><font color='#eabe10'>3% of the hero's Missing Health</font></b>. \n\n Radius: 700",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_8_0": "Hero gains 1 Necromastery Soul every 6/3 seconds",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_8_1": "Hero gains <b><font color='#eabe10'>1</font></b> Necromastery Soul every <b><font color='#eabe10'>6</font></b>/3 seconds",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_8_2": "Hero gains <b><font color='#eabe10'>1</font></b> Necromastery Soul every 6/<b><font color='#eabe10'>3</font></b> seconds",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_9_0": "Every 6 seconds, the hero's attack consumes 1 Soul, causing the next attack to deal critical damage and fear the target. \n\n Critical Damage: 120% \n Fear Duration: 0.5 sec.",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_9_1": "Every <b><font color='#eabe10'>6</font></b> seconds, the hero's attack consumes 1 Soul, causing the next attack to deal critical damage and fear the target. \n\n Critical Damage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>120%</font></b> \n Fear Duration: 0.5 sec.",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_10_0": "Necromastery Maximum Soul Increase: 2/4/6",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_10_1": "Necromastery Maximum Soul Increase: <b><font color='#eabe10'>2</font></b>/4/6",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_10_2": "Necromastery Maximum Soul Increase: 2/<b><font color='#eabe10'>4</font></b>/6",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_10_3": "Necromastery Maximum Soul Increase: 2/4/<b><font color='#eabe10'>6</font></b>",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_11_0": "Increases Damage per Soul for Necromastery: 0.5/1/1.5",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_11_1": "Increases Damage per Soul for Necromastery: <b><font color='#eabe10'>0.5</font></b>/1/1.5",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_11_2": "Increases Damage per Soul for Necromastery: 0.5/<b><font color='#eabe10'>1</font></b>/1.5",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_11_3": "Increases Damage per Soul for Necromastery: 0.5/1/<b><font color='#eabe10'>1.5</font></b>",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_12_0": "Removes the maximum Soul limit for Requiem of Souls. \n\n Requiem of Souls' Souls return, dealing 50% of their Damage. \n\n The Hero does not lose Necromastery Souls upon death.",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_12_1": "<b><font color='#eabe10'>Removes</font></b> the maximum Soul limit for Requiem of Souls. \n\n Requiem of Souls' Souls return, dealing <b><font color='#eabe10'>50%</font></b> of their Damage. \n\n The Hero <b><font color='#eabe10'>does not lose</font></b> Necromastery Souls upon death.",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_13_0": "Increase Attack Speed per Necromastery Soul: 1/1.5/2",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_13_1": "Increase Attack Speed per Necromastery Soul: <b><font color='#eabe10'>1</font></b>/1.5/2",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_13_2": "Increase Attack Speed per Necromastery Soul: 1/<b><font color='#eabe10'>1.5</font></b>/2",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_13_3": "Increase Attack Speed per Necromastery Soul: 1/1.5/<b><font color='#eabe10'>2</font></b>",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_14_0": "Each attack increases the current and maximum number of Necromastery Souls by 1. \n\n Duration: 3 sec.",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_14_1": "Each attack increases the current and maximum number of Necromastery Souls by <b><font color='#eabe10'>1</font></b>. \n\n Duration: 3 sec.",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_15_0": "Magic Resistance Reduction from Presence of The Dark Lord: 5%/10%/15%",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_15_1": "Magic Resistance Reduction from Presence of The Dark Lord: <b><font color='#eabe10'>5%</font></b>/10%/15%",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_15_2": "Magic Resistance Reduction from Presence of The Dark Lord: 5%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>10%</font></b>/15%",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_15_3": "Magic Resistance Reduction from Presence of The Dark Lord: 5%/10%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>15%</font></b>",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_16_0": "Shadowraze Bonus Damage Increase: 30/60 \n\n Shadowraze reduces Enemy Movement Speed: 6%/12% \n\n Duration: 5 sec.",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_16_1": "Shadowraze Bonus Damage Increase: <b><font color='#eabe10'>30</font></b>/60 \n\n Shadowraze reduces Enemy Movement Speed: <b><font color='#eabe10'>6%</font></b>/12% \n\n Duration: 5 sec.",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_16_2": "Shadowraze Bonus Damage Increase: 30/<b><font color='#eabe10'>60</font></b> \n\n Shadowraze reduces Enemy Movement Speed: 6%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>12%</font></b> \n\n Duration: 5 sec.",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_17_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'> Reduces duration of Shadowraze stacking effect: 1/2/3 sec. </font></b> \n\n Shadowraze stacking effect cannot be dispelled. \n\n Shadowraze Cooldown Reduction: 1/3/5 sec.",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_17_1": "<b><font color='#ff0000'> Reduces duration of Shadowraze stacking effect: <b><font color='#eabe10'>1</font></b>/2/3 sec. </font></b> \n\n Shadowraze stacking effect <b><font color='#eabe10'>cannot be dispelled</font></b>. \n\n Shadowraze Cooldown Reduction: <b><font color='#eabe10'>1</font></b>/3/5 sec.",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_17_2": "<b><font color='#ff0000'> Reduces duration of Shadowraze stacking effect: 1/<b><font color='#eabe10'>2</font></b>/3 sec. </font></b> \n\n Shadowraze stacking effect <b><font color='#eabe10'>cannot be dispelled</font></b>. \n\n Shadowraze Cooldown Reduction: 1/<b><font color='#eabe10'>3</font></b>/5 sec.",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_17_3": "<b><font color='#ff0000'> Reduces duration of Shadowraze stacking effect: 1/2/<b><font color='#eabe10'>3</font></b> sec. </font></b> \n\n Shadowraze stacking effect <b><font color='#eabe10'>cannot be dispelled</font></b>. \n\n Shadowraze Cooldown Reduction: 1/3/<b><font color='#eabe10'>5</font></b> sec.",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_18_0": "Necromastery Maximum Souls Increase by 1 for every 30 Intelligence. \n\n <b><font color='#ff0000'> Maximum bonus is reached at 600 Intelligence. </font></b>",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_18_1": "Necromastery Maximum Souls Increase by <b><font color='#eabe10'>1</font></b> for every <b><font color='#eabe10'>30 Intelligence</font></b>. \n\n <b><font color='#ff0000'> Maximum bonus is reached at 600 Intelligence. </font></b>",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_19_0": "Reduces Total Damage Taken during Feast of Souls: 10% \n\n Reduces ability cast delay during Feast of Souls: 40%",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_19_1": "Reduces Total Damage Taken during Feast of Souls: <b><font color='#eabe10'>10%</font></b> \n\n Reduces ability cast delay during Feast of Souls: <b><font color='#eabe10'>40%</font></b>",
    "modifier_shadow_fiend_20_0": "Requiem of Souls Cooldown Reduction: 20/40/60 sec.",
